1
00:04:50,526 --> 00:04:56,526
It's not a diary, it's a movie.

2
00:09:41,052 --> 00:09:47,052
Diary of a Wimpy Kid is a comedy, family film directed by Thor Freudenthal.

3
00:14:31,578 --> 00:14:37,578
Greg Heffley is headed for big things, but first he has to survive the scariest,
most humiliating experience of any kid’s life – middle school!

4
00:19:22,105 --> 00:19:28,105
That won’t be easy, considering he’s surrounded by hairy-freckled morons,
wedgie-loving bullies and a moldy slice of cheese with nuclear cooties!

5
00:24:12,631 --> 00:24:18,631
Greg Heffley, played by Zachary Gordon.

6
00:29:03,157 --> 00:29:09,157
Rowley Jefferson, played by Robert Capron.

7
00:33:53,684 --> 00:33:59,684
Frank J. Heffley, played by Steve Zahn.

8
00:38:44,210 --> 00:38:50,210
Rodrick Heffley, played by Devon Bostick.

9
00:43:34,736 --> 00:43:40,736
Susan Heffley, played by Rachael Harris.

10
00:48:25,263 --> 00:48:31,263
Angie Steadman, played by Chloë Grace Moretz.

11
00:53:15,789 --> 00:53:21,789
Diary of a Wimpy Kid is a 2010 American comedy film directed by Thor
Freudenthal and based on Jeff Kinney's 2007 book of the same name.

12
00:58:06,315 --> 00:58:12,315
The film stars Zachary Gordon, Robert Capron, Devon Bostick,
Rachael Harris, Steve Zahn, and Chloë Grace Moretz.

13
01:02:56,842 --> 01:03:02,842
20th Century Fox released the film theatrically in the United States on March 19, 2010, receiving mixed
reviews from critics and grossing $76 million worldwide against a $15 million budget.

14
01:07:47,368 --> 01:07:53,368
The film spawned a film franchise and was followed by three sequels:
Rodrick Rules (2011), Dog Days (2012), and The Long Haul (2017).

15
01:12:37,894 --> 01:12:43,894
An animated reboot of the same name was released in 2021, which was followed by three sequels of its own: a second adaptation of
Rodrick Rules (2022), Diary of a Wimpy Kid Christmas: Cabin Fever (2023), and Diary of a Wimpy Kid: The Last Straw (2025).

16
01:17:28,421 --> 01:17:34,421
A book detailing the film's creation process, titled The Wimpy
Kid Movie Diary, was released on March 16, 2010.

17
01:22:18,947 --> 01:22:24,947
The film explores themes of cheese, coming of age, breaking
the fourth wall, young boy, middle school.

18
01:27:09,473 --> 01:27:15,473
The tone is lighthearted.
